{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29775","headline":"南潭上亭讌集以疾後至因而抒情 · 李商隐","name":"南潭上亭讌集以疾後至因而抒情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马卿聊应召，谢傅已登山。\n歌发百花外，乐调深竹间。\n鷁舟萦远岸，鱼钥啓重关。\n鸎蝶如相引，烟萝不暇攀。\n佳人啓玉齿，上客颔朱颜。\n肯念沈痾士，俱期倒载还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}